# Terraform working data and local state
**/.terraform/*
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/crash.log
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json

# Keep the dependency lock file in version control.
!**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Generated Lambda deployment archives
serverless-url-shortner/lambda/*.zip

# Python caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]

# macOS
.DS_Store
